# Guides

Durable how-tos not tied to one phase: local setup, setting up a provider, backups and restore, a launch preflight. One per file as `GUIDE_<NAME>.md`; `GUIDE_` is a filename namespace, and the H1 stays a human title.

A spec that adds a setup step for people (a provider account, a webhook, a key) updates or adds a guide in the same change.

